synopsis:
  Add ``GHC.Internal.Unboxed.Do`` for do-notation over unboxed values
description:
  The new module ``GHC.Internal.Unboxed.Do`` provides ``QualifiedDo``
  operations for ``State#``-passing code. Bound variables can have any
  representation (``Word#``, ``MutableByteArray# s``, ``(# Word#, Word# #)``,
  ...) and unit actions of type ``State# s -> State# s`` can be used as
  statements.
